<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20522" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">hērēdĭtārĭus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj.
		hereditas, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>relating to an
				inheritance</i>, <i>inherited</i>, <i>hereditary</i> (class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">auctio,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Caecin. 5, 13</span></i>
			; cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lites,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Quint. 3, 10, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">agri,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					Ep. 7, 11, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cognomen quod habes hereditarium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Rep. 6, 11</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">imperium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Curt.
					10, 7 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">jus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Flor.
					3, 13 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">bellum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 3,
					17</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">paupertas (with vetus),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Val.
					Max. 4, 3, 8</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">res,</span>”
				<i>an inheritance</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Gai. Inst. 2, 9</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aes alienum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					ib. 3, 84</span></i>
			 al.—<i>Adv.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">hērēdĭtārĭē</span></b> ,
				<i>by inheritance</i> (late Lat.), <i><span class="en">Vulg. Ezech.
				46, 16</span></i>.</div>
